            "scenario": "Four players (P, Q, R, S) play a single round-robin tournament where each player plays every other player once. A win gives 1 point, draw gives 0.5 points, loss gives 0. P scored 2.5 points, Q scored 2.0 points, R scored 1.0 point.",
