            "questionType": "MCQ",
            "questionText": "A solution of 60 liters contains milk and water in the ratio 3:2. How many liters of water must be added so that the ratio of milk to water becomes 1:1?",
            "options": [
              "A. 12 liters",
              "B. 15 liters",
              "C. 18 liters",
              "D. 20 liters"
            ],
            "correctAnswer": "A. 12 liters",
