            "category": "Arithmetic",
            "questionType": "TITA",
            "questionText": "Pipe A can fill a tank in 12 hours, while Pipe B can empty it in 20 hours. If both pipes are opened together, how many hours will it take to fill the tank?",
            "correctAnswer": "30",
