            "section": "QA",
            "category": "Arithmetic",
            "questionType": "TITA",
            "questionText": "A trader sells a product at a 20% discount on the marked price and still makes a profit of 25%. If the cost price is $400, what is the marked price ($)?",
            "correctAnswer": "625",
