            "passageTitle": "Reading Comprehension 1: Sociological Stratification & Technology",
            "passageText": "The study of Sociological Stratification & Technology reveals profound structural interactions between empirical methodologies and theoretical abstractions. Historical paradigms often assumed linear progression in scientific discovery; however, recent evidence highlights non-linear shifts driven by contextual anomalies. When researchers re-examine foundational assumptions, unexpected epistemological tensions emerge, questioning conventional frameworks.",
